WEBVTT

00:03:56.916 --> 00:04:00.716
to embrace this new geographic approach.

00:04:00.756 --> 00:04:02.316
The geographic approach is a way

00:04:02.316 --> 00:04:04.556
to bring all this information together

00:04:04.596 --> 00:04:08.156
to see holistically
how things are interrelated.

00:04:08.476 --> 00:04:11.156
A science-based approach
which is inclusive,

00:04:11.156 --> 00:04:13.556
that can bring together
multiple populations

00:04:13.556 --> 00:04:17.476
to be able to create
more intelligent actions

00:04:17.516 --> 00:04:19.876
and create a more sustainable future.

00:04:20.596 --> 00:04:24.836
These kinds of advances
in technology and information

00:04:24.836 --> 00:04:26.756
are increasingly available,

00:04:26.796 --> 00:04:29.756
but it's going to take more
than simply technology

00:04:29.796 --> 00:04:31.276
to create a sustainable future.